      "created_at": "2025-07-31T05:31:54.901Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I didnt know the describe command was this useful, thanks.</p>\n<p>At first when running a custom helm chart I got this error<br>\nWarning  FailedScheduling  100s (x2 over 103s)  default-scheduler  0/1 nodes are available: 1 node(s) didn’t find available persistent volumes to bind. preemption: 0/1 nodes are available: 1 Preemption is not helpful for scheduling.</p>\n<p>After following the instructions in <a href=\"http://helm.erpnext.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">helm.erpnext.com</a> and installing nfs now I get<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/0/9006449cea230094b4c75a4bc7240f5d08efcdba.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9006449cea230094b4c75a4bc7240f5d08efcdba\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/9006449cea230094b4c75a4bc7240f5d08efcdba_2_690x396.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ky6bsOdpw6uYfcE669ZAwvKX8a6\" width=\"690\" height=\"396\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/9006449cea230094b4c75a4bc7240f5d08efcdba_2_690x396.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/9006449cea230094b4c75a4bc7240f5d08efcdba_2_1035x594.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/0/9006449cea230094b4c75a4bc7240f5d08efcdba.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"161616\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1040×597 144 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
